  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex PolyTour Rev is an octagonal shaped polyester monofilament engineered for intense bite, control and maximum spin. Its SIF (Silicone oil Infused Filament) technology, developed in cooperation with NANODAX, is designed to increase string movement and snapback speed, helping aggressive baseliners generate heavy rotation. Available in 1.20, 1.25 and 1.30 mm gauges, PolyTour Rev is positioned for medium-to-fast swing speeds and players seeking a firm, responsive shaped polyester with high spin potential.",

    "zh": "Yonex PolyTour Rev 是一款八边形异形聚酯单丝球线，核心定位是 Intense Bite、Control 与 Ultimate Spin。它采用与 NANODAX 合作开发的 SIF（Silicone oil Infused Filament）技术，将硅油融入单丝材料中，以提升球线移动速度和 Snapback 效率，从而帮助中高速挥拍的底线球员制造更强烈的旋转。PolyTour Rev 提供 1.20、1.25 和 1.30 毫米三个线径，整体属于 Yonex PolyTour 家族中偏硬、响应快、旋转能力非常突出的 Shaped Poly。"
  },

